{"ref":"character:crewmate-dino","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Crewmate Dino is a playable character from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors. Their starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Report!.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:report"}," ",{"t":"Report!","r":"weapon:report"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Crewmate"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["C1_CREWMATE"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["C1_Crewmate"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Report!.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:report"}," ",{"t":"Report!","r":"weapon:report"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Find and open the coffin in ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 100"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Coffin","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-No_Pirates_Among_Us.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"No Pirates Among Us\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Crewmate is unlocked for purchase by finding and opening their coffin in ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},". They need to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 100, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Crewmate can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"redissus\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Crewmate starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},". Crewmate gains minor stat bonuses every time a unique weapon or passive item is upgraded to its maximum level, with no limit. This passive also includes maximum level items by teammates in multiplayer."]},{"k":"p","c":["Active weapons will randomly provide one the following stats upon reaching max level, multiplied by the number of levels that weapon has:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},": +4%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},": +4%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},": +4%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},": +4%"]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Passive weapons will provide the follow stats upon reaching max level, multiplied by the number of levels that passive has:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},": +20"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},": +0.1"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},": +0.2"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},": +8%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},": -3%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},": +0.2"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},": +0.2"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Magnet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:magnet"}," ",{"t":"Magnet","r":"powerup:magnet"},": +0.5"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},": +5%"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},": +5%"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Crewmate gains bonuses any time they or a teammate upgrades a weapon to maximum level, making them stronger in multiplayer."]},{"c":["The Darkana ",{"i":"Sprite-Hail_from_the_Future_(X).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"}," ",{"t":"Hail from the Future (X)","r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"}," can provide up to 14 additional sources of stat increases due to the ",{"t":"Candyboxes","r":"weapon:candybox"}," and ",{"t":"Arma Dios","r":"weapon:arma-dio"}," it spawns."]},{"c":["In order to maximize on Crewmate's stat bonuses in single player, it is recommended to choose weapons that unite together to open new spaces in the inventory, as this will allow the stat boost to trigger more times per run. Relevant weapons include ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellString.png","w":12,"h":14,"r":"weapon:spellstring"}," ",{"t":"SpellString","r":"weapon:spellstring"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStream.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstream"}," ",{"t":"SpellStream","r":"weapon:spellstream"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStrike.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstrike"}," ",{"t":"SpellStrike","r":"weapon:spellstrike"}," (uniting into ",{"i":"Sprite-SpellStrom.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spellstrom"}," ",{"t":"SpellStrom","r":"weapon:spellstrom"},"); ",{"i":"Sprite-Endo_Gears.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:endo-gears"}," ",{"t":"Endo Gears","r":"weapon:endo-gears"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Peri_Pendulum.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"}," ",{"t":"Peri Pendulum","r":"weapon:peri-pendulum"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Myo_Lift.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:myo-lift"}," ",{"t":"Myo Lift","r":"weapon:myo-lift"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Epi_Head.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:epi-head"}," ",{"t":"Epi Head","r":"weapon:epi-head"}," (uniting into ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Tower.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-tower"}," ",{"t":"Clock Tower","r":"weapon:clock-tower"},"); ",{"i":"Sprite-Dextro_Custos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dextro-custos"}," ",{"t":"Dextro Custos","r":"weapon:dextro-custos"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Sinestro_Custos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sinestro-custos"}," ",{"t":"Sinestro Custos","r":"weapon:sinestro-custos"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Centralis_Custos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," ",{"t":"Centralis Custos","r":"weapon:centralis-custos"}," (uniting into ",{"i":"Sprite-Trinum_Custodem.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"}," ",{"t":"Trinum Custodem","r":"weapon:trinum-custodem"},"); ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Anger.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-anger"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Anger","r":"weapon:dominus-anger"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Hatred.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Hatred","r":"weapon:dominus-hatred"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Dominus_Agony.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dominus-agony"}," ",{"t":"Dominus Agony","r":"weapon:dominus-agony"}," (uniting into ",{"i":"Sprite-Power_of_Sire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:power-of-sire"}," ",{"t":"Power of Sire","r":"weapon:power-of-sire"},"); ",{"t":"Peachone","r":"weapon:peachone"}," and ",{"t":"Ebony Wings","r":"weapon:ebony-wings"}," (uniting into ",{"t":"Vandalier","r":"weapon:vandalier"},"); ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"}," and ",{"t":"Vento Sacro","r":"weapon:vento-sacro"}," (uniting into ",{"t":"Fuwalafuwaloo","r":"weapon:fuwalafuwaloo"},"); and ",{"t":"Phiera Der Tuphello","r":"weapon:phiera-der-tuphello"}," and ",{"t":"Eight The Sparrow","r":"weapon:eight-the-sparrow"}," (uniting into ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"},")."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Weapons which evolve multiple times, such as the ",{"t":"Bracelet","r":"weapon:bracelet"}," or weapons from the Emerald Diorama DLC, are also recommended."]}]}},{"c":["Due to upgrading a passive item also triggering Crewmate's effect, weapons from the Emergency Meeting DLC are very effective picks, as their evolution items are subsumed into the evolved weapon, opening up a new spot in the inventory."]},{"c":["By far the most key weapon for Crewmate is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"},", this weapon evolves an unlimited number of times, triggering Crewmate's ability every time one of its forms is upgraded to maximum level. Having this weapon alone mostly negates the need for any of the above weapons."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Crewmate_Dino.png","w":115,"h":120,"c":["Crewmate Dino's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Crewmate_Dino.gif","w":111,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Crewmate_Dino_-_trailer.png","w":106,"h":150,"c":["Crewmate Dino as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1WMUJ_YMPlY"}," of Emergency Meeting."]},{"i":"Emergency_Meeting.png","w":200,"h":113,"c":["Crewmate Dino as seen in the cover art of Emergency Meeting (near the center)."]}]}]}]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Crewmate","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/wiki/Crewmate"}," at the ",{"t":" Among Us Wiki","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}